.TH "organica-by-faemiyah" "6" "2024-05-08" "Organica User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
organica-by-faemiyah - the command to run Organica.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
organica-by-faemiyah [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Organica is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah in August 2007.
Ranked 9th at Assembly 2007.
.PP
Warma [Additional code] Trilkk [Code] Juippi [Music]
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
-f, \[en]fullscreen : Fullscreen mode (default).
.PP
-w, \[en]windowed : Windowed mode (resizable window).
.PP
-r, \[en]record : Do not run in real time, save the audio as a .wav file
and the frames as .png files.
.PP
Any other argument prints the list of valid options.
.SH KEYS
.PP
f : Toggle fullscreen.
.PP
Esc, q : Quit.
.SH INFO
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=31532
.SH BUGS
.PP
